t.co.uk/2017/09/sams-vmworld-2017-before-i-go/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;**&lt;img class="alignright wp-image-8259" src="https://www.definit.co.uk/images/2017/09/VMworld-2017.jpg" alt="" width="204" height="89" &gt;a non-VMware employee&lt;/a&gt;! I am very much looking forward to meeting friends old and new during the week, so if you see me come say hi!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>